<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta content='text/html; charset=UTF-8' http-equiv='Content-Type' />
  <style>
    body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; }
    .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }
    .header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #420099, #9747FF); color: white; padding: 30px; text-align: center; border-radius: 10px 10px 0 0; }
    .content { background: #f9f9f9; padding: 30px; border-radius: 0 0 10px 10px; }
    .password-box { background: #e8f4fd; border: 2px solid #420099; border-radius: 8px; padding: 20px; margin: 20px 0; text-align: center; }
    .password { font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; color: #420099; letter-spacing: 2px; }
    .footer { text-align: center; margin-top: 30px; color: #666; font-size: 14px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>Welcome to Juicy Meets!</h1>
    </div>

    <div class="content">
      <h2>Hello <%= @user.email %>!</h2>

      <p>Welcome to Juicy Meets! Your account has been successfully created.</p>

      <p>Here's your password to access your account:</p>

      <div class="password-box">
        <div class="password"><%= @password %></div>
      </div>

      <p><strong>Important:</strong> Please keep this password safe. You can use it to log in to your account.</p>

      <p>If you forget your password, you can always request a new one through the "Forgot Password" feature.</p>

      <p>Thank you for joining Juicy Meets!</p>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
      <p>This is an automated message from Juicy Meets. Please do not reply to this email.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
